### MEDIUM: gemini (gemini-code-assist[bot])
**File**: `packages/gui-web/src/InventorySurfaces.tsx:170`
![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

### Robust & Efficient Job Lookup

Instead of reversing the array of all jobs and finding the first match (which relies implicitly on object key insertion order and performs multiple array operations), we can iterate through the jobs in a single pass and explicitly compare the `started_at` ISO timestamps to find the latest job for the given app.

```
function jobForApp(appId: string, jobs: Record<string, GuiAppActionJobSummary>, selectedJob: GuiAppActionJobSummary | null): GuiAppActionJobSummary | null {
  if (selectedJob?.app_id === appId) {
    return selectedJob;
  }

  let latestJob: GuiAppActionJobSummary | null = null;
  for (const job of Object.values(jobs)) {
    if (job.app_id === appId) {
      if (!latestJob || job.started_at > latestJob.started_at) {
        latestJob = job;
      }
    }
  }
  return latestJob;
}
```

